WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.950
[Soft original electronic score]

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.688
Sometimes a new world starts at a neighbourhood party.

00:00:05.538 --> 00:00:12.422
Hip hop's beginnings are often traced to a Bronx party hosted by D. J. Kool Herc in nineteen seventy three.

00:00:13.272 --> 00:00:19.760
What began locally would become a global cultural language, shaped by many people and communities.

00:00:20.610 --> 00:00:27.443
This is a new visual interpretation of that history, with no archival images or historic recordings.

